        "body":  "@kdeesi  I was able to replicate reliability issues with and with some modifications was able to get it working to a functional state. \n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/37b39744-7d20-4774-b070-0761d577999a\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/001ee52f-dc7e-4c65-b1a6-21c1278e7e1f\n\nThis was prior to your commit but to actually get it to work we needed to do a lot more than whats in this commit. \n\nRight now we are testing the official mujoco version of the simulator as it seems to have proper configuration suited for manipulation tasks than here with gazebo. That way we don\u0027t need to modify the official robotmodel for stuff for it to work properly.\n\nIf it works out we\u0027ll be submitting a PR. \n\n",
