        "created_at":  "2026-09-06T08:26:13Z",
        "updated_at":  "2026-09-06T08:26:13Z",
        "body":  "Hi @WinnieThepo, i\u0027ve reverted the changes made to the stl files in tiago_pro.urdf in this commit https://github.com/dfl-rlab/erc_sim_2026/commit/4e0ce63b22e205392e33e732d9dbcf66ce36eaeb.  \n\nRegarding your comment on providing the files in the video, the test_book file is the exact same code as the one provided in this commit, and as for the test_world, you should be able replicate that behaviour in erc_world after this commit. Please try that and let me know when you can pick up the books fine. Once confirmed I will merge this branch to main so you can continue building.\n\nAlso note that the books in the physical competition will have 2cm spine widths following this update to the simulation",
